<title>USA: Thermo Optek ends Laser Science merger talks.</title>
<headline>Thermo Optek ends Laser Science merger talks.</headline>
<dateline>WALTHAM, Mass. 1996-12-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Thermo Optek Corp said Thursday that it has ended merger talks with Laser Science Inc.</p>
<p>As a result, the company said, it has withdrawn its registration to issue up to 400,000 shares of common stock in connection with the acquisition.</p>
<p>Thermo Optek, a subsidiary of Thermo Instrument Systems Inc, develops and makes chemical analysis instruments.</p>
</text>
